Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 14:49:03 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Data model update on receiving channel preference report
 message

1. modified channel preference data model as per TR181 standars -
   Device.WiFi.DataElements.Network.Device.{i}.Radio.{i}.OpClassPreference.{i}
2. Added OpclassPreference event to intimate the preference has update to the
   application dependent on datamodel

Signed-off-by: Sudharsan Eswaran <eswaran@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
